  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the lentils and drain well.",
    "In a large bamboo tray or steamer basket, combine the lentils and 4 cups of water.",
    "Bring the water to a boil and then reduce the heat to low.",
    "Steam the lentils for 20-25 minutes or until tender.",
    "In a small saucepan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté for 5-7 minutes or until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sauté for 1-2 minutes or until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin, ground coriander, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Remove the lentils from the steamer and fluff with a fork.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the tray with the lentils and stir to combine.",
    "Pour the rice vinegar over the lentils and rice mixture.",
    "Stir to combine and serve hot."
  ],
